{"suttaId":"tha-ap70","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[4418,4445],"vripara":"53"},"segments":{"tha-ap70:0.3":"Ambadāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap70:1.1":"“Anomadassī bhagavā, nisinno pabbatantare;","tha-ap70:1.3":"Mettāya aphari loke, appamāṇe nirūpadhi.","tha-ap70:2.1":"“Kapi ahaṃ tadā āsiṃ, himavante naguttame;","tha-ap70:2.3":"Disvā anomadassiṃ taṃ [anomaṃ amitaṃ (sī.), anomamadhitaṃ (syā.)], buddhe cittaṃ pasādayiṃ.","tha-ap70:3.1":"“Avidūre himavantassa, ambāsuṃ phalino tadā;","tha-ap70:3.3":"Tato pakkaṃ gahetvāna, ambaṃ samadhukaṃ adaṃ.","tha-ap70:4.1":"“Taṃ me buddho viyākāsi, anomadassī mahāmuni;","tha-ap70:4.3":"Iminā madhudānena, ambadānena cūbhayaṃ.","tha-ap70:5.1":"“Sattapaññāsakappamhi, devaloke ramissati;","tha-ap70:5.3":"Avasesesu kappesu, vokiṇṇaṃ saṃsarissati.","tha-ap70:6.1":"“Khepetvā pāpakaṃ kammaṃ, paripakkāya buddhiyā;","tha-ap70:6.3":"Vinipātamagantvāna, kilese jhāpayissati.","tha-ap70:7.1":"“Damena uttamenāhaṃ, damitomhi mahesinā;","tha-ap70:7.3":"Pattomhi acalaṃ ṭhānaṃ, hitvā jayaparājayaṃ.","tha-ap70:8.1":"“Sattasattatikappasate, ambaṭṭhajasanāmakā;","tha-ap70:8.3":"Catuddasa te rājāno, cakkavattī mahabbalā.","tha-ap70:9.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap70:10.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ambadāyako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap70:11.1":"Ambadāyakattherassāpadānaṃ aṭṭhamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2646,"to":2647,"paras":[{"para":2646,"vripara":"53","refs":["tha-ap70:1"],"words":["anomadassī bhagavā","mettāya aphari loke  appamāṇe nirūpadhī"],"lines":["So aparabhāge attanā katakusalabījaṃ disvā somanassajāto attano pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>anomadassī bhagavā</b>tiādimāha.","<b>Mettāya aphari loke, appamāṇe nirūpadhī</b>ti so bhagavā sabbaloke appamāṇe satte “sukhī hontū”tiādinā nirupadhi upadhivirahitaṃ katvā mettāya mettacittena aphari patthari vaḍḍhesīti attho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap70:1"],["tha-ap70:1"]]},{"para":2647,"vripara":"54","refs":["tha-ap70:2"],"words":["kapi ahaṃ tadā āsiṃ"],"lines":["<b>Kapi ahaṃ tadā āsin</b>ti tadā tassāgamanakāle kapirājā ahosinti attho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap70:2"]]}]},"tika":null}
